### Health
GET {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Bootstrap First Admin
POST {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/bootstrap/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{userEmail}}",
  "password": "{{userPassword}}",
  "displayName": "Patrick",
  "roles": ["admin"]
}

### Create User
POST {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "email": "patrick@example.com",
  "password": "Sup3rS3cret!",
  "displayName": "Patrick",
  "roles": ["admin"]
}

### List Users
GET {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Update User Password
PATCH {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "password": "Sup3rS3cret!"
}

### Public Runtime Config
GET {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/public/runtime-config
Host: {{publicHostname}}

### Get Tenant Registration Settings
GET {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/registration-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Enable Tenant Registration
PATCH {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/registration-settings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "enabled": true
}

### List Tenant Public Hosts
GET {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/public-hosts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create Tenant Public Host
POST {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/public-hosts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "hostname": "{{publicHostname}}",
  "isPrimary": true
}

### Disable Tenant Registration
PATCH {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/registration-settings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "enabled": false
}

### Delete Tenant Public Host
DELETE {{adminApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/public-hosts/{{publicHostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
